    "longDescription": "Orgzly is an outliner for taking notes and managing to-do lists.\n\nYou can keep notebooks stored in plain-text and have them synchronized with a directory on your mobile device, SD card, Dropbox, or over WebDAV.\n\nNotebooks are saved in Org mode's file format. “Org mode is for keeping notes, maintaining TODO lists, planning projects, and authoring documents with a fast and effective plain-text system.” See https://orgmode.org for more information.",
